      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, left hand page",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>the E(lder) Faraj All\u0101h al-Kharaz\u012b (the maker of beads) 5 1/2</li>\n<li>anonymous gift 7 1/2</li>\n<li>Ibrah\u012bm known as the YTWN 14</li>\n<li>anonymous gift 25</li>\n<li>the \u1e25(aver) Fakhr al-K\u0101f\u012b 2</li>\n<li>the Kohen Ya\u02bfq\u016bb i(bn) \u02bfAnn\u0101b 9</li>\n<li>the \u1e25(aver) \u02bfAf\u012bf al-Nush\u0101dir\u012b (the dealer in sal ammoniac) 19</li>\n<li>[Ab]\u016b Y\u016bsuf his father 9 1/2</li>\n<li>anonymous gift 12</li>\n<li>\u02bfAbd al-W\u0101\u1e25id i(bn) Yesha 6</li>\n<li>the \u1e25(aver) Shams \u1e6c\u012bb\u012b 12</li>\n<li>anonymous gift 13 1/2</li>\n<li>the E(lder) M\u016bs\u0101, (street of) the turners</li>\n<li>anonymous gift 13</li>\n<li>anonymous gift 15</li>\n<li>anonymous gift 24</li>\n<li>anonymous gift 70</li>\n<li>M\u016bs\u0101 i(bn) Sasson 6</li>\n<li>M\u016bs\u0101 i(bn) al-Balaqs\u012b 6</li>\n<li>M\u016bs\u0101 i(bn) D\u0101\u02be\u016bd 6</li>\n<li>Yosef the cantor 5 1/2</li>\n<li>the \u1e25(aver) Na\u1e63r All\u0101h i(bn) al-\u1e62\u016br\u012b 5</li>\n<li>anonymous gift 8 1/2</li>\n<li>anonymous gift 15</li>\n<li>M\u016bs\u0101 i(bn) Ri\u1e0d\u0101 10</li>\n<li>Ibrah\u012bm i(bn) al-\u1e24\u0101shir (son of the tax-payment rallier) 9</li>\n<li>320</li></ol>\n",
